da01e4b6-ce71-4166-b2af-73b9b55aee42	3fbaeb24-813f-49cd-9e06-cf7d58b8d2bc	Lập trình ứng dụng di động	lập-trình-ứng-dụng-di-động	Khóa học này cung cấp cái nhìn toàn diện về **nền tảng Công nghệ Thông tin và Phần mềm**, đặc biệt tập trung vào các khái niệm cốt lõi cần thiết cho lập trình ứng dụng di động. Học viên sẽ nắm vững kiến thức về kiến trúc hệ thống, nguyên lý hoạt động của phần mềm, hệ điều hành (Android/iOS), mạng máy tính và cơ sở dữ liệu. Sau khi hoàn thành, bạn sẽ có khả năng **phân tích yêu cầu, thiết kế cấu trúc ứng dụng** và đưa ra các quyết định công nghệ sáng suốt, tạo tiền đề vững chắc để phát triển các ứng dụng di động hiệu quả và tối ưu. Đây là bước đệm quan trọng giúp bạn xây dựng sự nghiệp vững chắc trong lĩnh vực lập trình di động đầy tiềm năng.	2	t	[-0.0050114603,-0.010805628,0.022695797,-0.062435616,-0.04399519,0.002845716,-0.01592206,0.005032167,-0.010108129,-0.0013020596,-0.032203384,0.017990865,-0.013360653,0.013827927,0.17289196,0.0008519331,0.01258378,0.0045268475,0.020037513,-0.016267573,0.03897272,0.006867344,0.024589531,-0.031128675,-0.02728109,0.008615608,0.02992248,0.043571044,0.027353404,-0.058150098,-0.032295197,0.010729095,0.034111936,0.029200532,-0.018699016,0.008053998,0.0258243,-0.013666807,-0.01727307,0.004902576,-0.004614774,0.0019953593,-0.009875595,0.0008199636,0.02517822,-0.0017990083,-0.021834565,-0.03285854,0.025200987,0.01230502,0.018591145,0.00089459366,-0.0096959695,-0.30188453,0.0020681894,-0.018617695,-0.022756217,-0.025195193,-0.042437002,-0.0055969334,-0.040249556,0.05089067,-0.031980675,-0.0027435594,-0.0010898928,-0.040668674,0.03881728,0.029836506,-0.015610272,-0.007772633,-0.015872585,0.005226743,-0.014700414,-0.025197463,-0.043792,-0.046403117,0.007954948,-0.012358344,0.04170317,0.030742992,0.0036262479,-0.011403681,0.010376525,0.04178857,-0.014099427,-0.0071352907,0.002870179,-0.025105037,-0.0017795964,-0.009259012,-0.01825673,0.018116776,0.0047389385,-0.010491663,-0.017842524,-0.0063956673,-0.04851377,0.00