4e66095b-fcfd-4613-9cdc-a7cac904ac01	3fbaeb24-813f-49cd-9e06-cf7d58b8d2bc	Lập trình web	lập-trình-web	Chủ đề này cung cấp cái nhìn tổng quan toàn diện về **Công nghệ Thông tin (CNTT)** và **Phần mềm**, những nền tảng không thể thiếu cho mọi lập trình viên web. Học viên sẽ nắm vững các khái niệm cốt lõi về hệ điều hành, mạng máy tính, cơ sở dữ liệu và quy trình phát triển phần mềm, từ đó xây dựng một kiến thức vững chắc về cách các hệ thống hoạt động. Kỹ năng đạt được bao gồm khả năng phân tích yêu cầu hệ thống, hiểu rõ kiến trúc ứng dụng và giải quyết vấn đề hiệu quả. Việc ứng dụng thực tế sẽ giúp bạn phát triển các ứng dụng web mạnh mẽ, tối ưu hóa hiệu suất và đưa ra quyết định công nghệ sáng suốt, chuẩn bị vững chắc cho các chuyên đề chuyên sâu hơn.	1	t	[-0.027676607,-0.0077844216,0.02650676,-0.06594678,-0.011416376,0.02620558,0.0043876376,-0.010683068,0.00259097,-0.013465769,-0.0361072,0.012043673,-0.011426028,-0.008880319,0.18911888,-0.0065252697,0.014575514,-0.0053676507,0.021479856,-0.009869699,0.029221933,-0.010114861,0.015364503,-0.028765341,-0.034234706,-0.015764581,0.014969968,0.016004732,0.04781268,-0.049019497,-0.005525208,0.028947918,0.026345884,0.020583099,-0.02422486,-0.001157505,0.019899558,0.00022871645,-0.013330916,0.0039065653,-0.011028468,-0.014492907,-0.00045001614,-0.009404544,0.017771801,0.0014488096,-0.009433221,-0.029041285,0.004362914,0.008500329,0.01778506,-0.0112490235,-0.01879346,-0.2922386,0.02022697,-0.022951793,-0.008394169,-0.03246804,-0.013711808,-0.020518392,-0.03828453,0.03680621,-0.02884056,-0.00057603244,-0.020344753,-0.02861446,0.04135805,0.017194318,-0.007160687,0.0013173702,0.0092458455,-0.012411038,-0.039394103,-0.011979018,-0.037475735,-0.053254027,0.0017924132,-0.034602433,0.016358899,0.017762454,-0.013833959,-0.008443207,0.0045808936,0.042179763,-0.0038093906,0.020135898,0.0015630805,-0.026013132,0.030527897,0.0007381353,-0.013918628,0.01629244,-0.018369308,-0.017026074,-0.011554599,-0.002218849,-0.038423736,-0.0007587106